1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,900
Every night… the same notebook.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,900
Sales on paper. Stock lists in chat. Totals on a calculator.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
It works — until the business grows.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,900
So what if this page could become a tool your whole team uses?

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,400
Start by describing what you need, in plain words.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,800
That is your prompt.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,200
AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini or Copilot

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
can help you build a first version:

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,800
a form, a table, a daily summary.

10
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:36,800
Then you test it. Enter real examples. Check every total.

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,800
Something missing? Ask AI to add it.

12
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:46,800
When it works, share it with your team.

13
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,800
Every sale goes into one shared record.

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,800
Less copying. Clearer numbers. More time to run the business.

15
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,800
Build and deploy with AI. AI For Business.
